  <Intro>k__BackingField: The clans lost the war for the crown, and now they fight over its bones. By the old law, a chief who wants the clans must first beat the chiefs who say no. Harald Axe says no the loudest.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: Harald Axe kneels in the ash and swears the oath. His clan follows him, grumbling. Clans always grumble.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Defeat Harald Axe.
  <Loss>k__BackingField: Grom must not fall.
